WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:16.031
I see a hamster on Monday.

2
00:00:16.032 --> 00:00:30.439
I see a rabbit on Tuesday.

3
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:46.079
I see a kitten on Wednesday.

4
00:00:46.080 --> 00:01:01.915
I see a puppy on Thursday.

5
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:18.263
